// docs/CONVENTIONS.md, "Determinism rules": every decision draws from the seeded functions in
// @wayford/core, so a run can be replayed from its seed. Matches Math.random called or not,
// reached through ?. or a global object, and destructured from Math.
or {
  `Math.random`,
  `Math?.random`,
  `$_.Math.random`,
  `$_.Math?.random`,
  `{ $props } = Math` where { $props <: contains `random` }
} as $random where {
  register_diagnostic(span=$random, message="Math.random makes a run impossible to replay. Draw from rng(seed) or hash(seed, key) in @wayford/core (docs/CONVENTIONS.md, Determinism rules).")
}
